  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: 27-28 dominoes. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "27-28 dominoes refers to block or draw domino games using a standard double-6 set of 28 tiles (0-0 through 6-6). Players draw 7 tiles each (4 players); highest double leads. Players match a number on an open end; doubles are placed crosswise. Cannot play: draw from boneyard or pass. First to empty hand wins and scores sum of opponents' pips; or lowest hand wins if blocked.",
    objective: 'Play all your tiles first, or have fewest pips if blocked.',
    gameplay: 'Highest double leads. In turn, match one number to an open end. Doubles placed crosswise. If cannot play, draw until you can or boneyard empty then pass.',
